WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.800
Store the starting value
points &lt;- 4; points = 4
Assignment stores the right-hand value.

2
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:09.600
Add to the current value
points &lt;- points + 3; 4 + 3 = 7; points = 7
Calculate first, then replace the stored value.

3
